    <trans-unit id="metadata.conversion.fileMetadataEnabled"><source>Quick captions are not currently used because file metadata fallback is enabled. To convert Quick captions, disable file metadata fallback, save the gallery, then convert.</source><target>Raske bildetekster brukes ikke for øyeblikket fordi metadata-reserve er aktivert. For å konvertere, deaktiver metadata-reserve, lagre galleriet og konverter deretter.</target></trans-unit>
